+*   **Memory Complexity:** Requires storage for six $1000 \times 1000$ masks and the list of innerShell polygons [S1].
+*   **Strengths:** Reduces boundary occlusion noise by ignoring non-coplanar interior geometry. Optimizes rendering by conditionally emitting innerShell geometry based on neighbor occlusion [S1].
 *   **Limitations:** Fixed grid resolution ($1000$) may not suit all scenes. Unspecified details for mesh generation and caching may require implementation decisions [S1].
-*   **When to use:** When accurate boundary occlusion is required without false occlusion from internal geometry, and when neighbor-based culling of internal surfaces is beneficial.
